### Averaged-condition QC

The averaged Standard, Pitch Deviant, and Duration Deviant conditions were inspected visually in SPM. `MEG1821` was greyed/removed as expected. The deviant conditions were not perfectly symmetrical, but they were judged roughly bilateral and acceptable. No additional rogue channels were identified after averaging.

### Final decision

`sub-2259A` was retained and marked as fully preprocessed. The participant has fewer trials than ideal, but the remaining deviant trial counts were considered usable and the averaged conditions were judged acceptable for onward analysis.

